to. £3O ; (124) a magnificent Diamond Marquise Ring £3); (599) a lovely Pearl and Diamond Ring, magnificent quality, £25 (598) Diamond and Emerald Half-hoop, £7; (102) Diamond and Turquoise Half-hoop ; (648) Lady's Five-stone Opal Half-hoop. 18-at. gold setting, 25s ; (453) Lady's Five-stone Half-hoop Diamond Ring, £5 16s ; ,468) ditto, £55. ; (576). ditto. £7 10s ; (187) ditto, £9 9s ; (651) ditto, £l2 10s ; (447) Gent's Single-stone Old- Brazilian Diamond Ring. £27 10s ; (101) ditto, £35 ; (89), ditto, £3O ; (589), ditto. £l6 10. ; (153), a Circular Diamond Pendant, to form brooch, composed of the purest Brazilian Diamonds, a rare bargain, £55; (700) lovely Diamond Star, Brooch or Pendant, £3B 10s ; (555) another, £25; (3.8) pretty Diamond Ruby and Pearl Crescent Brooch. £7; (101) Unique Carved Opal Brooch, £2O ; (750) E. Regal Oriental Pearl and Diamond Necklace, £200; (117); Opal and Diamond Bracelet, fashionable style, £35 ; (104) Diamond and Sapphire Cluster Bracelet, £l7 10s (166) Diamond and Ruby, lfiat. gold, stylish, £5; pretty Pearl Bracelets. from £1 104 ; a large srlection of Bracelets, all genuine forfeited pledges ; (1.176) Gent's crold Altert. aovernment stamped each link, graduated curb pattern, very massive, £5, (1,109) ditto, £4 17s 6d ; (118) ditto,£2 15s; '1,334) ditto, £3 3s ; (1,177) ditto. £2 108 ; (1,318) Gent's Fashionable Fetter-link pattern, £2 14.; (1,299) ditto, £4 6s; (1.317) £2 10e ; (1,320) £2 13s • (1.168) Gent's handsome fancy pattern £2 15s; (124) £2 17s 6d ; (262) £2 10s ; (1,204) £2 ss; (1,291) Gent's Solid Gold Garb Albert £1 bs, marvel- lous value.</p>
        <p>i, It is admitted by the &amp;Aire jewellery trade that we have the Lergest Stock of Gold Alberts in Liverpool. Over 1,000 to select from. Value undeniable. SPECIAL OFFER.—A Gent's Solid Gold Albert. Govern- ment stamped each link, over one ounce in weight, £2 3s 6d. Valuables of all kinds Purchased, Exchanged, Sold on Commission, or received (in a confidential manner) as Security for Cash Adva3ces. Any of the above forwarded on approval carriage paid to any address. Quote Number and Article, WEND FOR OUR MONTHLY LIoT OF FORFEITED BARGAINS. POST FREE- Established 1821. Telephone 5,949.</p>
