        <head>OUR LOCAL CHURCHES.</head>
        <p>OUR LOCAL CHURCHES.</p>
        <p>Wycliffe P.S.A. Society. There was an average attendance at the meeting of this society on Sunday afternoon in Wycliffe Church. Mr Thomas Wallington presided. Th,) sp,aker for the occasion was Mr Milne, of Sale, and he delivered a very thoughtful address. Two srgos entitled " Arm, arm ve brave" and "The La .d of Home," were effioleltly sung by Mr Foulkes. The service was also taken part in by Mr B Farrar (boa secretary) and Mr John AtkinsJn.</p>
