        <p>It most I,e noted that the above estimate includes nothing for the receipts from goods traffic, nor from the supply of current for lighting or power purposes. All the Dirntors reside within the District served by the Company. They have also substantial interests in the progress and prosperity of South Lancashire. _ _ _</p>
