        <p>The Vend-Ts to this Comoany of the whole of th liciel Shares. vil th.refore of the beneficial rights in the undertak- ings of the above Companies. are Messrs. James Basnett Atherton and Jacob Atherton, who dnring the past three years have bents engaged in obtaining for the Companies the valuable rowers they now possess, and are the promoters of the Comp:n.7. They have themselves paid the whole of the very heavy expenses of forming the various Companies, and obtaining the powers from Parliament, the Light Railway Commissioners, and the Board of Trade. The price is to be paid as to £50.000 in cash. and as to the balanca by the allotment of 50,000 paid-up Preference Shares and 250,000 paid-up Ordinary Shares of the Company,</p>
